Why this directory exists
-------------------------
Benchmarks in this collection (ISPASS-2009, parts of Rodinia, Pannotia,
LonestarGPU) were written against the SDK's cutil helper library and its
headers. Newer CUDA toolkits stopped shipping these entirely - CUDA 11 removed
the bundled samples - so helper_timer.h and friends have no upstream source
anymore, and the SDK's own prebuilt libcutil_x86_64.a is x86-only.

setup_environment used to download the full 152 MB SDK installer at setup time
just to obtain these files. Of the 49 headers in that download, the benchmarks
reference 6; the rest is DirectX interop, GL widget toolkits and sample code.
Vendoring the ~450 KB actually needed removes the download, removes the
dependency on a 2012-era NVIDIA URL remaining reachable, and lets the library be
built for whatever architecture the host actually is rather than x86_64 only.

Contents
--------
inc/   16 headers: the transitive closure the benchmarks and the cutil sources
       require (cutil, timers, command-line parsing, bank checker, exceptions),
       plus shrUtils.h/shrQATest.h used by the gpuwattch-ubench 'power' target.
src/    7 sources compiled into lib/libcutil_<arch>.a by setup_environment.
lib/   build output, not checked in.
